# ai-sec-labs upstream sources
#
# Format (tab-separated):  name <TAB> url <TAB> ref <TAB> license
#
# `ref` MUST be a full 40-char commit SHA for anything you depend on.
# A branch name is accepted but fetch-upstream.sh will warn: upstream can
# change under you and silently break a lab.
#
# Nothing here is vendored into this repo. Each source is cloned into
# upstream/<name>/ at its pinned ref and left untouched; our changes live
# in overlays/ and are applied on top. See overlays/README.md.

llmvault	https://github.com/CyberSunil/LLMVault	c300ed563dd14cfce8426f33d7dde7bc554ad259	MIT
dvap	https://github.com/sonuoffsec/DVAP	980305ef3b9561acc090970596f33015bc9e0be8	Apache-2.0
dvmcp	https://github.com/harishsg993010/damn-vulnerable-MCP-server	main	MIT

